@ERP_Stock_Movement_HostAddress = http://localhost:5094

### Create product
POST {{ERP_Stock_Movement_HostAddress}}/api/product
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Widget",
  "price": 19.99
}

### List products
GET {{ERP_Stock_Movement_HostAddress}}/api/product

### Set inventory
POST {{ERP_Stock_Movement_HostAddress}}/api/inventory
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 100
}

### Get inventory for product
GET {{ERP_Stock_Movement_HostAddress}}/api/inventory/1

### Create order
POST {{ERP_Stock_Movement_HostAddress}}/api/order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 5 }
  ]
}

### List orders
GET {{ERP_Stock_Movement_HostAddress}}/api/order
